## API Endpoints

### Upload & Parsing
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/upload` | Upload Excel + PDF for a given month |
| `GET` | `/api/uploads` | List all uploaded batches |
| `GET` | `/api/uploads/:id/status` | Check processing status of an upload |

### Employees
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/employees` | Search/filter employees. Query params: `name`, `department`, `division`, `file_no`, `ippis_number`, `gl`, `page`, `per_page` |
| `GET` | `/api/employees/:id` | Employee detail + all payslip history |

### Payslips
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/payslips` | List payslips with filters (employee, month, department, etc.) |
| `GET` | `/api/payslips/:id` | Full payslip detail (earnings + deductions breakdown) |

### Analytics (Phase 2)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/analytics/department-summary` | Total salary, avg salary, headcount per department |
| `GET` | `/api/analytics/gl-distribution` | Employee count and salary totals per GL level |
| `GET` | `/api/analytics/deduction-breakdown` | Most common deductions, totals by category |
| `GET` | `/api/analytics/salary-trends/:employee_id` | Month-over-month earnings/deductions for an employee |
| `GET` | `/api/analytics/monthly-overview` | Total payroll expenditure per uploaded month |

### AI Query (Phase 3)
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/query/natural-language` | Accept plain English query, return structured results |

### Export
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/export` | Export filtered results as CSV. Same filters as `/api/employees` |

