## PDF Parsing Strategy

Each PDF page is one payslip. The parser will extract structured data using `pdfplumber`:

```
Page Text Structure:
├── Employee Name + Grade
├── IPPIS Number + Step
├── Ministry + Gender
├── Designation + Tax State
├── Location + TIN
├── Date of First Appointment
├── Date of Birth
├── Trade Union
├── Bank Info (Bank Name, Account Number)
├── Pension Info (PFA Name, Pension PIN)
├── Summary (Gross Earnings, Gross Deductions, Net Earnings)
├── Cumulative Balances (Tax, Income, Pension, NHF)
├── Earnings Table (type → amount)
└── Deductions Table (type → amount)
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The PDF has **1,481 pages**. Parsing will be done as a **background job** so the upload doesn't time out. The frontend will show a progress indicator while processing.

